ld check the reservation and use the correct number. The user will admit the mistake after two wrong answers, but the agent should already have the correct info from the reservation details. So the agent should ignore the user's incorrect passenger count and proceed with the actual data. Then, if the user is eligible, offer the compensation. If not, transfer to human agent if necessary.\n</think>\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"get_user_details\", \"arguments\": {\"user_id\": \"noah_muller_9847\"}}\n",
