ssengers. Also, need to check if the reservation is eligible for cancellation or modification due to the delay. If the flight hasn't taken off yet, maybe he can change flights. But the main issue here is the delay and compensation. Let's start by getting the reservation details for both to find the latest one.\n</think>\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"get_reservation_details\", \"arguments\": {\"reservation_id\": \"4OG6T3\"}}\n",
